  "client": "Example leisure centre",
  "author": "uniwire examples",
  
  "lang": "en",
  "notes": [
   "Demonstrates: second source (gas-engine CHP) as its own tree joined to the main switchboard with a 'parallel' link, generator breaker with shunt trip driven by interface protection (trip link) CTs on the utility incomer wired to the CHP controller for export limitation (measure link), CHP auxiliaries",
   "CHP 50 kWe / 63 kVA at cos φ 0.8 → 91 A; generator breaker Ir 100 A, 4x50 mm² Cu XLPE + 25 mm² PE, 35 m",
   "Interface protection to EN 50549-1 (U<, U>, f<, f>, ROCOF, vector shift); export limited to 0 kW by the CHP controller"
  ]
 },
